  "body": "Fixes #7694\n\n`cleanText` in `pm-stack/aggregator/src/actions.ts` capped every dashboard-action payload field with `slice(0, max)` in UTF-16 code units, so an astral character straddling a cap was stored as a lone high surrogate in the persisted actions file (verified by probe against the real module: a 2,000-cap `reason` ending in `\\ud83d`, which UTF-8-encodes to U+FFFD for downstream consumers).\n\nFix mirrors the #3178 guard in `pm-stack/dispatch/src/validate.ts`: when the cap would split a surrogate pair, the pair is dropped whole (cut at `max - 1`). Cap semantics otherwise unchanged.\n\nTests: new regression test in `test/actions.test.ts` (reason cap 2,000 straddle dropped whole, exact-fit pair kept whole, optionId cap 200 straddle) — fails on pre-fix code, passes post-fix. `bun test test/actions.test.ts`: 27/27 pass on branch. Full aggregator suite shows only run-varying failures in unrelated areas (render/events/collector), also present on clean main.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796736191&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7698&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7698&signature=f7631255cf8808a5f169f780e5f874b2da81938ebee60d588336bec7843198f2\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7698?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
